<title>UK: Aerolineas Argentinas sets $50 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Aerolineas Argentinas sets $50 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Citicorp Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AEROLINEAS ARGENTINAS</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     10.25     MATURITY    02.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE   SECURITISED   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING    BA	  PAY FREQ    MONTHLY</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ARGENTINE HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER A $150 MLN CREDIT CARD RECEIVABLES</p>
<p>		SECURITISATION PROGRAMME. COUPON AND PRINCIPAL</p>
<p>		PAYMENTS WILL BE PAID SECOND DAY OF EVERY MONTH</p>
<p>		COMMENCING JUNE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
